{"id":"d84b20445a48e126","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-cor-gch-holds.md","title":"GCH in L","display":"cor-gch-holds — GCH in L","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-gch-holds","aliases":["58-cor-gch-holds"],"display":"cor-gch-holds — GCH in L","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-gch.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[./58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-gch-holds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-gch-holds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gch-holds — GCH in L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch.md\">../batch08/58-df-gch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" href=\"?note=bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" title=\"./58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md\">58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch.md\">../batch08/58-df-gch.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(L\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" href=\"?note=bdf91bc7ddbdd903\" title=\"./58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md\">58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gch\\text{-}holds} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gch\\text{-}holds} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel proved <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(L \\models_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is a proper class, so this is not the set-coded satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>This gives the consistency of GCH with ZFC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch.md","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-gch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdf91bc7ddbdd